    <string name="ns_about">About</string>
    <string name="ns_about_message">Nighthawk is a Stealth/DarkFi-oriented wallet experience built from the former shielded-wallet codebase.\n\nYou alone control your keys—back up your recovery phrase immediately.\n\nNetwork sync, chat (DarkIRC-style), and privacy tooling rely on backend infrastructure you choose or operate yourself; defaults are convenience-only.\n\nThird-party exchange, card-on-ramp, and legacy vendor integrations have been removed from this tree.\n\nThis software is provided “as is”, without warranty of any kind.</string>
