    <string name="autoshielding_title_text"><b>Privacy by design.</b> DarkFi confirms transfers privately—there is no separate transparent balance lane to consolidate.</string>
    <string name="autoshielding_body_text">Older forks talked about auto-shielding between transparent and shielded pools. On DarkFi this app tracks <b>one wallet balance</b> from your configured endpoint; QR codes may still expose different receive encodings for compatibility.\n\nAlways verify addresses out-of-band for high-value sends.</string>
    <string name="autoshielding_button_positive">Great!</string>
