    <string name="strict_omr_only">Strict UnifOMR sync</string>
    <string name="strict_omr_only_detail_msg">When enabled, Nighthawk only discovers payments that include UnifOMR clues (faster and more private). Leave off (default) to also trial-decrypt compact blocks so you can receive from other DarkFi wallets such as the drk CLI. Turning this on can hide/miss syncing those non-UnifOMR payments.</string>
